WEBVTT

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.457
- Snap!
- [gasps] Yes, yes, yes, yes!

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:12.832
No way.

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:14.874
Oh, yeah. Way.

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:16.583
[♪ triumphant music plays]

00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:20.832
Ready, Sheriff?

00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:22.125
Punch it, Lily.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.917
[electrical humming]

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:29.666
[radio beeps]

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:30.833
[whirring]

00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:38.416
Whoa.

00:00:38.417 --> 00:00:40.582
Fly. Be free!

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:41.667
Show-offs!

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:51.124
[laughs] Wow.

00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:52.625
Whoo-hoo!

00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:54.542
- Whoo!
- Whoo!

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:56.166
[laughs]

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:58.249
Now, this is flying.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.457
With style!

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:02.208
Yeehaw!

00:01:07.542 --> 00:01:08.957
So, we're clear on the plan?

00:01:08.958 --> 00:01:11.124
Once you're at Bonnie's,
you send the message.

00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:13.124
Blaze brings me and Bullseye to the house,

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:15.499
and this time, they connect!

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.707
Jessie, wait.
What if Bonnie rejects you again?

00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:20.416
If they become friends, it's all worth it.

00:01:20.417 --> 00:01:22.000
Yes, Sheriff.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:26.082
Huh? Wait. Jessie, wait!

00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:27.250
What?

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:29.916
What is it, Buzz?

00:01:29.917 --> 00:01:31.124
Just listen to me.

00:01:31.125 --> 00:01:33.166
I... I've been trying
to ask you this, and if...

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:35.624
if I don't do it now, I never will.

00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:37.708
- [♪ romantic music plays]
- Will you...

00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:40.416
Buzz, you can do this.

00:01:40.417 --> 00:01:41.833
Will... Will...

00:01:44.958 --> 00:01:45.958
[gasps]

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.333
You're stuck with me, Deputy.

00:01:56.042 --> 00:01:57.916
Cheer up, boys. She'll be back.

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.417
We have a plan!

00:01:59.917 --> 00:02:02.541
At ease, Ranger. At ease.

00:02:02.542 --> 00:02:03.500
[music ends]

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:10.875
[♪ somber music plays]

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.083
[whirring]

00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:24.582
Men, you know your mission.

00:02:24.583 --> 00:02:25.667
Yes, Commander.

00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:27.750
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

00:02:30.292 --> 00:02:31.541
Woody! Buzz!

00:02:31.542 --> 00:02:33.041
- What?
- [Rex] Lily!

00:02:33.042 --> 00:02:34.541
- Oh, no, no, no.
- Foul device.

00:02:34.542 --> 00:02:35.832
What's she doing here?

00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:37.416
She's one of us, guys. Deal with it.

00:02:37.417 --> 00:02:38.499
Listen up, everyone.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.707
Lily and Jessie
have a plan to help Bonnie.

00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:42.541
Okay, what do you need us to do?

00:02:42.542 --> 00:02:43.499
Nothing.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.374
- Nothing?
- That's easy.

00:02:45.375 --> 00:02:47.082
Jessie already did the hard work.

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:48.249
Classic Jessica.

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:51.375
All that's left for me
is to send a message.

00:02:53.167 --> 00:02:54.249
[whirring]

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:56.083
[♪ happy music plays]

00:03:06.042 --> 00:03:07.292
[grunts]

00:03:09.417 --> 00:03:11.167
It's up to the girls now.

00:03:12.042 --> 00:03:13.208
[yawns]

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.042
[music continues]

00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:19.666
hi Blaze

00:03:19.667 --> 00:03:21.208
[gasps]

00:03:22.333 --> 00:03:23.166
it's Bonnie

00:03:23.167 --> 00:03:24.916
I changed my mind

00:03:24.917 --> 00:03:26.500
[giggles]

00:03:31.958 --> 00:03:34.457
Hey, sweetie.
Look what I found in the car.

00:03:34.458 --> 00:03:35.416
[gasps]

00:03:35.417 --> 00:03:37.624
It's okay. We turned off the chat.

00:03:37.625 --> 00:03:39.333
[♪ somber music plays]

00:03:46.625 --> 00:03:48.083
[doorbell rings]

00:03:54.375 --> 00:03:56.749
Bonnie. You have a friend at the door.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:57.833
[gasps]

00:03:58.792 --> 00:04:00.166
<i>- Let's try to beat...
-</i> Hi, Bonnie.

00:04:00.167 --> 00:04:02.250
- <i>...our high score.</i>
- I brought your dolls.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:05.707
Bonnie, come say hi.

00:04:05.708 --> 00:04:06.833
Okay.

00:04:15.417 --> 00:04:16.458
Hi.

00:04:17.292 --> 00:04:18.292
Hi.

00:04:26.042 --> 00:04:27.916
I'm sorry. I don't play with toys--

00:04:27.917 --> 00:04:29.667
I played with her a little yesterday.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.041
I like it when she's like,

00:04:32.042 --> 00:04:34.042
"I ain't afraid of nothin', partner."

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.000
[chuckles]

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.792
That... That was weird.

00:04:43.292 --> 00:04:44.833
Uh... I...

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:46.583
Sorry I bothered you.

00:04:51.583 --> 00:04:53.041
- Oh, no. Don't go.
- No, no, no.

00:04:53.042 --> 00:04:54.667
- She can't go. She can't go.
- No, no, no, no.

00:04:56.583 --> 00:04:57.625
Blaze!

